returns only an observation and step returns four values. reset has no seed argument; matching constructor seeds alone is insufficient unless episode/reset order also matches.","limitations","guidance","list","配置步骤","ordered",true,"items",[79,80,81],"setup","Install crafter and pygame in an isolated Python environment.","Run python -m crafter.run_gui for manual controls, then use CrafterReward-v1 for automation.","Set the seed when constructing the environment and record the episode index; use crafter.Recorder with a nonempty output directory, save_stats=True and save_episode=True to retain completed-episode statistics and action trajectories.","可以尝试的任务",false,[86,87,88],"testTasks","Measure survival and achievement success over held-out world seeds.","Plan a resource-to-tool sequence with a fixed interaction budget.","Change a recipe and verify that collection, crafting and achievement recording remain consistent.","AI 使用与评估条件","Designed for agent evaluation. For pixel-only tests, withhold info.semantic, inventory and player_pos from the policy; those expose structured state beyond the RGB observation. Keep published benchmark budgets separate from custom VLM protocols.","aiUseNote","links","参考依据",[96,97,98,99],"evidence",{"_58":106,"_25":107},{"_58":104,"_25":105},{"_58":102,"_25":103},{"_58":100,"_25":101},"Pinned completed-episode recorder contract","https://github.com/danijar/crafter/blob/e04542a2159f1aad3d4c5ad52e8185717380ee3a/crafter/recorder.py","Pinned reset, seed and privileged info contract","https://github.com/danijar/crafter/blob/e04542a2159f1aad3d4c5ad52e8185717380ee3a/crafter/env.py","Achievement-based evaluation","https://github.com/danijar/crafter#evaluation","Observation, actions and recorder","https://github.com/danijar/crafter#interface","查看许可条款",[111],"licenseUrl",{"_58":108,"_25":112},"https://github.com/danijar/crafter/blob/main/LICENSE","许可类别","开放许可资源","terms","provenance","资产许可","Repository material under its MIT notice; track any replacement art separately.","assetLicense","代码许可","MIT.","codeLicense","开始使用",[126],"access",{"_58":127,"_25":128,"_129":130},"Free package and playable GUI","https://github.com/danijar/crafter#play-yourself","note","pip install crafter pygame; the GUI and evaluation environment run locally.","主要来源",[134],"sourceUrl",{"_58":131,"_25":135},"https://github.com/danijar/crafter","技术栈","Python · Gym interface · pixel survival","stack","适用方向",[142],"dimensions","2D","测试目标",[146,147],"uses","代码修改与自动试玩","视觉、控制与规划","资源类型","AI 评估环境","lead","summary","environment",[165,166],[164],{"_58":127,"_25":128,"_129":130},"open",[160,161,162,163],[86,87,88],[79,80,81],{"_58":106,"_25":107},{"_58":104,"_25":105},{"_58":102,"_25":103},{"_58":100,"_25":101},"2d","coding","playing",{"_168":169},"documents",{"_67":170,"_35":171},[173,177,178,179,176,180,181,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,175,212,174,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233],[172,173,174,175,176],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalog","contributing","media-sources","icon-sources","c